# .clineignore — Cline Context Optimization
#
# This is a Cline-specific optimization, not a Harness governance requirement.
# It implements the Harness "avoid loading by default" context strategy through
# Cline's native exclusion mechanism.
#
# Cursor does not read this file; it is safe to maintain alongside Cursor artifacts.

# Legacy reference code — loaded only for targeted behavioral research
DocAPI/Legacy/_LegacySheetsDb/

# Financial domain — out of scope until clinical migration completes
DocAPI/Core/Finance/

# Binary and generated artifacts
DocAPI/bin/
DocAPI/obj/
DocFront.Web/bin/
DocFront.Web/obj/
DocAPI.Tests/bin/
DocAPI.Tests/obj/

# Node artifacts (if present)
node_modules/

# IDE and tooling
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

# Screenshots and demos (large binary assets)
Documentation/ScreenShots/
Documentation/Demo/

# AI research chat logs and historical research artifacts
# (Loaded explicitly when needed for harness research tasks)
Documentation/AI-Harness/research/*-chat-*.md